[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=System Update
Name[cs]=Aktualizace systému
Name[el]=Ενημέρωση συστήματος
Name[es]=Actualización del sistema
Name[fr]=Mises à jour
Name[it]=Aggiornamento di sistema
Name[ru]=Обновление системы
Comment=Update YaguareteOS, Flatpaks, and more
Comment[cs]=Aktualizace YaguareteOS, Flatpaků a dalších
Comment[el]=Ενημερώνει το YaguareteOS, τα Flatpaks και άλλα
Comment[es]=Actualizar YaguareteOS, Flatpaks y más
Comment[fr]=Met à jour YaguareteOS, les applications et plus encore
Comment[it]=Aggiorna YaguareteOS, i Flatpak e altro
Comment[ru]=Обновить YaguareteOS, Flatpak и многое другое
Icon=yaguarete-update
Categories=ConsoleOnly;System;
Terminal=true
Exec=/usr/bin/ujust update
# NoDisplay=true is appended at build time by the Containerfile, and only
# when bazzite-updater is actually installed -- that package ships a Qt GUI
# doing the same update through uupd-manual.service, plus rollback and
# release notes, rebranded as "Yaguarete Updater". Two update entries side
# by side confused the menu. This entry is hidden rather than deleted so
# `ujust update` stays reachable for anyone who wants the console path, and
# it stays visible on any variant that lacks the package.
